WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:01.569
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.518 --> 00:00:05.241
So many stands, and Maya has to run to each one!

3
00:00:05.241 --> 00:00:08.578
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08.578 --> 00:00:11.085
This is Episode 68.

5
00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:13.157
Meet the grown-up desk.

6
00:00:13.157 --> 00:00:16.675
The button board shows every stand in little pictures.

7
00:00:16.675 --> 00:00:18.277
Press a button.

8
00:00:18.277 --> 00:00:19.615
Click!

9
00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:21.543
A stand opens.

10
00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:24.241
Easy to see, easy to press.

11
00:00:24.241 --> 00:00:26.217
That is the Console.

12
00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:28.989
The whisper tube is for quick helpers.

13
00:00:28.989 --> 00:00:32.013
Whisper once, and ten stands open.

14
00:00:32.013 --> 00:00:34.181
Whisper it again tomorrow.

15
00:00:34.181 --> 00:00:35.868
Same result.

16
00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.844
That is the CLI.

17
00:00:37.844 --> 00:00:40.459
And the wise turtle checks everything.

18
00:00:40.459 --> 00:00:42.664
Too many coins spent here!

19
00:00:42.664 --> 00:00:44.760
A gate left open there!

20
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.953
It holds up little tips.

21
00:00:46.953 --> 00:00:49.157
That is Trusted Advisor.

22
00:00:49.157 --> 00:00:51.700
Three helpers, one desk.

23
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.037
Now you know the grown-up desk!

24
00:00:54.037 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

